+    voxel_sampling_field(Spec,field_v1(_,Spacing,_,_)),
+    Step is 8*Spacing//1000,Maximum is 3*Step.
+voxel_brush_controls(W,range(-1000000,1000000,100),range(600,2000,100)) :- lobby_terrain_world(W).
